        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2113, Contemporary Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door offers security to sliding doors. The Contemporary Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is operated from the exterior by a key and by a thumbturn from the interior. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door. The Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim is available in a large selection of finishes. It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls (one for each side of the door), a keyed mortise lock, and the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2116\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2114\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2115\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3.43\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 17/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Projection: 23/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2116-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek 2113 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door",
                "description": "The Modern Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door offers security to sliding doors. The Contemporary Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is operated from the exterior by a key and by a thumbturn from the interior. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door. The Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim is available in a large selection of finishes. It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls (one for each side of the door), a keyed mortise lock, and the mounting hardware.",
